6. Added additional properties that might be needed by the table (sorting, columnFilters, etc.)

The main differences from the previous approach:
- Using a proper Context Provider instead of just passing a value prop
- Implementing actual state management with useState
- Providing a more complete set of table-related properties and functions
- Creating a proper context consumer hook

This implementation should properly provide the DataTable context that the BookingStatusLineChart component needs. If you encounter any other errors, please let me know and I'll help you resolve them.

